{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"সুনান ইবনে মাজাহ","section":{"7":"Fasting"},"section_detail":{"7":{"hadithnumber_first":1638,"hadithnumber_last":1782,"arabicnumber_first":1638,"arabicnumber_last":1782,"name_native":"সিয়াম (রোজা) অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1678,"arabicnumber":1678,"text":"। ‘আয়িশাহ্ (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, রাসূলুল্লাহ সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম রোযারত অবস্থায় সুরমা লাগিয়েছেন।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":7,"hadith":41}}]}